================================================================================
SUMMARY (post-fix, after deploy with install.sh)
================================================================================

Backend  : 2 open MEDIUM in langchain-core; both are reachable only via code
           paths this app does not import (SSRF via Serper tool, HTML templating
           in GHSA-qh6h-p6c9-ff54). Full remediation is langchain 1.x upgrade,
           tracked for Phase 2.
Frontend : 0 open after install.sh pulls the pinned next 16.4.3.

Patch policy (ISO 27001 A.8.8):
  * Rerun pip-audit + npm audit before every production deploy (bake into
    install.sh if we want hard gating).
  * HIGH or CRITICAL blocks merge; MEDIUM allowed with a reachability note.
  * Advisories: PyPI OSV + GitHub Advisory DB (default feeds for pip-audit +
    npm audit).

